{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_st05",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_st05",
  "title": "Love of this Life",
  "storyCode": "OF-ST5",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_st05.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c157e7713df629f2836402b7349fd6630cba5761a9d320c1c6f2a92d7f24e5b4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Doctor, I have to blame you for what happened this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Everyone has been injured to some degree. As the leader, you're responsible for that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Gummy has already finished treating them, but it's going to sting if they get in the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Jeez, you need to show some more reservation when leading your teams."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Sorry...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "Um, it's not like I'm trying to trample on your good will..."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "That swimsuit looks good on you, Amiya.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "Is, is that so? Miss Savage picked it out for me... I was so worried that you wouldn't like it--"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "W-wait! Don't you try to play that trick on me, Dr. {@nickname}!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "We did go a bit overboard this time...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Good grief... And I have a word for Mister Hellagur as well!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I explicitly told him to keep an eye on you, so why did he turn a blind eye..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Until a contract is signed, Rhodes Island is not allowed to intervene in the internal affairs of an independent city-state."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "If we get caught up in legal repercussions, Rhodes Island will be in a very tight spot."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Actually, I already...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Yes, I know."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor, you really did something very dangerous."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...Why were you fighting with crazed fans anyway! If you're an adult, you should act like one."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "No matter how much you like a band, you need to be nice to the other audience members, and you certainly can't pick fights with them!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...? But we were...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "(Shush!)"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "No more questions! That wraps up this incident! Okay!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Be more careful next time, okay?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I know.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "All right!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor, come with me. I found lots of beautiful seashells on the other side of this reef. Beaches are absolutely fascinating!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "The water isn't cold... Hmm..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(Follow Amiya)",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "Come, Doctor, it's over here!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "(Splash Amiya with water)",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "Eek! Doctor! Please don't do that!"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "Darn it! Take this! Ahaha..."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "(Take Amiya's hand)",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_summer_2#2",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "Ehehe..."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, nice to see you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Ceylon told me many things about Rhodes Island, so I've been very keen on speaking with you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "How about taking a walk with me?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...That's fine.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Thank you, Doctor of Rhodes Island."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Had you not helped my daughter, her recklessness would have ended dismally."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "That wasn't recklessness.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "I actually didn't do very much.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "The one you should be thanking is Ceylon.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I trained Cronin myself. His instincts may be base, but he's also very capable. That's why I turned a blind eye on him all these years."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "However, as of the last few years, he's gone down a dangerous road, and I can no longer trust him."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "This time, I left Schwarz here on purpose just to see if he's still trustworthy."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The results were disappointing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Why are you telling me all this?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "...I enjoy walking along this part of the beach."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "That's because my wife, Barbara, sleeps deep beneath these waves."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I still remember that day; the weather was a bit warm, and the sunset was splendid. She turned to me here and said, 'If only we could stay here forever.'"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "In the blink of an eye, I was left behind."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Doctor, turn around and take a look."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Do you understand now? This city is a paradise I built for her."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "As for why I'm telling you this..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Because I can tell that you and I are the same type of person."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "In this world, not everything can be resolved with good. Sometimes, we must get our hands dirty."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I agree.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "I disagree.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Who knows...",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "For me, good and bad lost their meaning a long time ago. The only things that matter to me are results, and this city."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Why not tell Ceylon?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I'm not looking for understanding, Doctor."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "If I needed my daughter's understanding, we would not have become like we are now."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Besides, do you think she'd really understand if I told her?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "No. She still needs a long time to understand that the world isn't as black and white as she thinks."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Schwarz hopes that she will never understand, but I... Unfortunately, I lost the ability to make that choice."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Doctor, Ceylon would like to join you, so I asked Schwarz to accompany her. I'm fine with it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "After all, this Siesta is no longer her paradise."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I've seen the new geological report. Sooner or later, Siesta will be consumed by the magma."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "We've managed to postpone that day's coming. I am grateful for the effort that you've all put forth today."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Over the years, I've been looking for a solution to this matter. I have found it, but the price is almost as great."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The new development zone I've been working on will become a brand new nomadic city. By the looks of things, it will become the next Siesta."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I'm deeply attached to this place, but that doesn't mean that I can ignore the volcano that slumbers fitfully beside me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "After the end of this Obsidian Festival, we will begin moving into the new nomadic city. As for Siesta, we will let her rest until the magma reclaims her."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "The Obsidian Festival...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I heard that this ocean is bounded by land. Some have told me that this isn't a real ocean. It may be wide, but it's not boundless."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "In that case, we will continue to follow the coast. Perhaps one day, we will finally return to our starting point, the real starting point."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "However, by that time, this beautiful beach, the great Obsidian Festival, and this coastal city with its volcanic smell..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The Siesta that holds the memory of countless people, will be gone forever."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Perhaps one day, you'll be able to tell her what I've told you here today."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Perhaps that day will never come."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "And one day, should she perhaps need my help, you can come find me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "No matter where Siesta is or what it looks like, this city will forever support her."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Or rather, I should say... As long as Siestans exist, Siesta also exists. Within the hearts of young people like her are where Siesta really is."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Now, seize the day, and enjoy the Obsidian Festival."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "At least until we find another suitable location, we'll have to suspend our collaboration with Siren Records. I have a lot of things to discuss with them."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Schwarz seems to have something to tell you. She's over there."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "If I keep talking for much longer, she won't have anything to say. You should hear it from her."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "...Sir."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Don't mind me. This is between you youngsters."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "Hello."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What are you after?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Schwarz",
              "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
              "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
              "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
              "text": "Don't worry, I'm not your enemy anymore."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Hello, stranger?",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Schwarz",
              "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
              "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
              "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
              "text": "Oh, hello to you too, stranger."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Can I buy you a drink?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Schwarz",
              "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
              "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
              "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
              "text": "I'll pass for now."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "Actually, I wasn't really going to say anything special."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "At first, I was going to give you a good beating. Miss Ceylon never have been subjected to such danger."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "But, I have to thank you as well. Without your help, we might never have been able to clear up our misunderstanding."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "Truthfully, I did not want her getting involved with these things, but perhaps you were right. She has her own ideas, and her own responsibilities."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You should let her make her own decisions.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Time doesn't flow backwards. This is who she is now.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "That's a pity, isn't it?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "...Thank you. Were it not for you, everything I loved would have been destroyed by the volcano."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "I am in your debt."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Doctor!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Hey, Schwarz, what are you doing here?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "...Milady?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Perfect timing. I have something important to announce!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "I am going to submit my resume to Rhodes Island."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "?!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "As I said, I'm interested in joining your company."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "It's not easy to get in.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Heheh~ I already asked Miss Eyjafjalla and Miss Skyfire about it. They said I have their recommendations."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "After seeing your abilities throughout this whole situation, I've come to this decision after careful deliberation."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "But Rhodes Island is not a simple drug company..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "That's why I want you to come with me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "By the way, my father already approved of it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "...I know. If that is what you desire, milady."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "So, Doctor, we're going to be colleagues from now on!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Come on, Doctor! The experiment is about to start!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Ah fine, forget it. Schwarz, go drag Doctor over here!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "...Your voice is loud enough to crack the ceiling, milady. I'm sure the Doctor has heard it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "...Doctor, I don't know what you're waiting for, but in times like these, Miss Ceylon won't care what we're thinking."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "It would behoove you to walk over there yourself. It'd be a bit unsightly if you really wanted me to carry you over."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Come and get me!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Don't worry. I'll keep an eye on her.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "Very well."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "Please wait a moment, milady. We'll be there shortly."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#5",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "Let's go, Doctor."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
